        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk5-conditions-p04-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "要不然 / 不然: 要不然/不然 introduces an otherwise consequence",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "要不然/不然 introduces what follows if the preceding advice or requirement is not met. Identify the omitted negative condition.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "快走，要不然会迟到。",
                "pinyin": "kuài zǒu ， yàobùrán huì chídào 。",
                "meaning": "Leave quickly; otherwise you will be late.",
                "audio": "156dafb9b9125d4a27d35de9ffb405f1ededaaa497edd760ec2f927e9b6a4dd8"
              },
              {
                "text": "多穿一点儿，不然会冷。",
                "pinyin": "duō chuān yīdiǎnr ， bùrán huì lěng 。",
                "meaning": "Wear a little more; otherwise you will feel cold.",
                "audio": "bd8bc83324f436e34c6e62343c6c556e07b6f4459cd619730bb76c6a3c7d31c2"
              }
            ]
          },
